+# conversation-input-send-tooltip Specification
+
+## Purpose
+
+Describe the send-button hover hints used by pg-chat's new-conversation and existing-conversation composers.
+
+## Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Content-sensitive send tooltip
+
+Both `ConversationRoute` and `ConversationView` SHALL pass `chat.sendMessage` as `sendTooltip` and `chat.sendDisabledTooltip` as `emptyMessageTooltip` to a compatible release of `@epam/ai-dial-conversation-input`. The library SHALL own the live content check. Empty means no non-whitespace text, attachments, or inline selected skill. Other send restrictions SHALL NOT select the empty-message hint. Existing disabled-button and send behavior SHALL remain unchanged.
+
+#### Scenario: Empty composer
+
+- **WHEN** the user hovers over send with no content or only whitespace
+- **THEN** the tooltip shows `Type a message first`
+
+#### Scenario: Populated composer
+
+- **WHEN** the user hovers over send with text, an attachment, or a selected skill
+- **THEN** the tooltip shows `Send message`, including when sending is disabled for another reason
+
+#### Scenario: Draft changes
+
+- **WHEN** the user types or clears content, or sending clears the composer
+- **THEN** the tooltip follows the current content
